#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:3 c0d986d922d04b57b939d90285800e6f
msgid "This information is superceded by :ref:`common-landing-gear`"
msgstr "此信息已被 :ref:`common-landing-gear` 取代。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:7 08fe379dd2b04ec3bdebd09123cbe8d1
msgid "Archived: Landing Gear"
msgstr "存档：起落架"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:9 6f9cfaa2b7dc40e8b02ba548e494ad40
msgid ""
"Copter supports retractable Landing Gear activated by a servo mechanism "
"(like these sold by `Hobby King "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/quanum-600-class-quick-release-universal-"
"retractable-gear-set-680uc-pro-hexa-copter.html?___store=en_us>`__). The "
"gear can be manually retracted/deployed with an auxiliary switch. The gear "
"will also automatically deploy during landing."
msgstr ""
"ArduCopter支持由舵机机构驱动的可收放式起落架（如 `Hobby King "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/quanum-600-class-quick-release-universal-"
"retractable-gear-set-680uc-pro-hexa-copter.html?___store=en_us>`__ "
"上出售的产品）。起落架可通过辅助开关手动收起/放下。降落时起落架也会自动放下。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:14 d36fd19503dd46798fa5b1eb6751e33e
msgid ""
"There is some simple logic controlling the operation beyond simply "
"responding to retract/deploy commands from the controller.  If the system is"
" booted up and the landing gear control switch is in the retract position, "
"the landing gear will not retract.  This is done to prevent damage to the "
"landing gear or airframe should the switch be accidentally left in the "
"retract position on start-up.  In this case, the landing gear will not "
"retract until the switch is first moved to the deploy position, and then "
"back to the retract position."
msgstr ""
"除了简单响应控制器的收起/放下指令外，还有一些简单逻辑控制其操作。如果系统启动时起落架控制开关处于收起位置，起落架将不会收起。这样做是为了防止在启动时开关意外处于收起位置而损坏起落架或机架。在这种情况下，起落架须先将开关拨至放下位置，然后再拨回收起位置才能收起。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:23 a1548ea585804890b0662dfcff2c33ab
msgid ""
"The landing gear will automatically deploy when the flight mode is changed "
"to Land, during the final landing phase of RTL mode, and when a Land command"
" is executed in AUTO mode."
msgstr "当飞行模式切换至Land、RTL模式最终降落阶段，以及在Auto模式中执行Land指令时，起落架将自动放下。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:28 a3785405c96643cab3c7a4198a62c938
msgid "Support for landing gear was introduced in AC 3.3"
msgstr "AC 3.3版本中引入了对起落架的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:34 88b03d42d1a54b71be164d445d20327c
msgid "Connecting to the Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接到Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:36 bec7a054796a432c97645c76b22b77f4
msgid ""
"Most retractable landing gear will require just a single PWM cable to "
"connected to one of the AUX outputs on the back of the Pixhawk (AUX1 ~ "
"AUX4)."
msgstr "大多数可收放起落架只需一根PWM线缆连接到Pixhawk背面的其中一个AUX输出（AUX1～AUX4）即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:45 f7aad71c1dc64922a4959a5e74ee2ec4
msgid ""
"The signal wire (usually white) should be connected to the lower most \"S\" "
"pin."
msgstr "信号线（通常为白色）应连接到最下方的\"S\"引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:48 d67b998b7de04d918908cd2c7c522cc7
msgid "Setup through the Mission Planner"
msgstr "通过Mission Planner进行设置"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:50 46cbc380b92a4cfa9676bf3b5f1f162c
msgid ""
"Use the Mission Planner's Full Parameter List (or equivalent) to set the "
"following parameters:"
msgstr "使用Mission Planner的完整参数列表（或同等工具）设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:53 53230762ee6549b2b655d3ac345534d3
msgid ""
"If using AC3.5 (or higher) set ``SERVOn_FUNCTION to 29`` \"Landing Gear\", "
"where **n** is the number for the connected servo (e.g. "
":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` for AUX1, :ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO10_FUNCTION>` for AUX2 etc.)"
msgstr ""
"如果使用AC3.5（或更高版本），将 ``SERVOn_FUNCTION to 29`` （\"起落架\"），其中 **n** "
"为所连接舵机的编号（例如：AUX1对应 :ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>`，AUX2对应 "
":ref:`SERVO10_FUNCTION <SERVO10_FUNCTION>` 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:55 30ab095d389844608320eadbd847f8e9
msgid ""
"If using AC3.4.6 (or lower) set ``RCn_FUNCTION to 29`` \"Landing Gear\", "
"where **n** is the number for the connected servo (e.g. ``RC9_FUNCTION "
"<RC9_FUNCTION>`` for AUX1, ``RC10_FUNCTION <RC10_FUNCTION>`` for AUX2 etc.)"
msgstr ""
"如果使用AC3.4.6（或更低版本），将 ``RCn_FUNCTION to 29`` （\"起落架\"），其中 **n** "
"为所连接舵机的编号（例如：AUX1对应 ``RC9_FUNCTION <RC9_FUNCTION>``，AUX2对应 ``RC10_FUNCTION "
"<RC10_FUNCTION>`` 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:56 b84311f598b44f6ab640285808bf252a
msgid ""
"``LGR_SERVO_DEPLOY <LGR_SERVO_DEPLOY>`` — servo PWM value required to deploy"
" the landing gear."
msgstr "``LGR_SERVO_DEPLOY <LGR_SERVO_DEPLOY>`` — 放下起落架所需的舵机PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:58 952ddac906fe419b9e54947cb90b9ae7
msgid ""
"``LGR_SERVO_RTRACT <LGR_SERVO_RTRACT>`` — servo PWM value required to "
"retract the landing gear."
msgstr "``LGR_SERVO_RTRACT <LGR_SERVO_RTRACT>`` — 收起起落架所需的舵机PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:64 574cbd7a1e2943e684f0f516ecc40940
msgid "MissionPlanner: Landing Gear Configuration"
msgstr "Mission Planner：起落架配置"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:66 b7de23807d5748709ce369a808b958c1
msgid ""
"Set an :ref:`auxiliary switch <channel-7-and-8-options>` to \"Landing Gear\""
" in order to enable manual control (i.e. set CH7_OPT or CH8_OPT to \"29\")"
msgstr ""
"将一个 :ref:`辅助开关 <channel-7-and-8-options>` "
"设置为\"起落架\"以启用手动控制（即将CH7_OPT或CH8_OPT设置为\"29\"）。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:68 cb9339fb87f84387a39e3a5f545c67f3
msgid ""
"When the switch is in the \"low\" position the gear will be deployed, "
"\"high\" will be retracted, \"middle\" is a neutral position that will not "
"change the gear's state."
msgstr "当开关处于\"低\"位置时起落架放下，\"高\"位置时收起，\"中间\"位置为中立状态，不改变起落架状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/landing-gear.rst:73 4b57ef4185094ee7b92c07a1a98409e1
msgid "Mission Planner: Setting Manual Landing Gear Control"
msgstr "Mission Planner：设置手动起落架控制"
